{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3612160/extras/ac5d464e510a4a5e88ee9cc52e5083bb.avif?t=1769776492\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3612160/extras_big/ac5d464e510a4a5e88ee9cc52e5083bb.webp?t=1769776492 width=1560 height=353 /></span></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Game Overview</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Ashen Dungeon</strong> is a turn-based strategy RPG where players lead an expedition to explore dungeons, gather and craft resources, and engage in tactical combat.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Combining the unpredictability of dice rolls with the strategic use of skills, each turn requires careful decision-making and an awareness of luck to determine your path of growth.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Story &amp; Worldbuilding</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In a world where hope has vanished, chaos has taken hold.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >On the day the sky turned red, every mortal found their skin hardening for reasons unknown, plunging the world into confusion and fear.<br>Driven by terror, people began attacking one another \u2014 order collapsed, and trust turned into hatred.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this world where no one can be trusted, you must gather those who still possess the will to survive, form an expedition, and lead them through the ashes of despair.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Gameplay Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dungeon Exploration</strong> \u2013 Discover dangers and rewards as you delve into mysterious dungeons.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3612160/extras/9f3d837652ba3359df538ba6b4ce3b35.poster.avif?t=1769776492\" width=500 height=280 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3612160/extras/9f3d837652ba3359df538ba6b4ce3b35.webm?t=1769776492\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3612160/extras/9f3d837652ba3359df538ba6b4ce3b35.mp4?t=1769776492\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Turn-Based Combat</strong> \u2013 Engage in unpredictable, dice-based tactical battles that demand strategic thinking.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3612160/extras/ba5bb6215ecf180dd8679d5c0cc2a271.poster.avif?t=1769776492\" width=500 height=280 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3612160/extras/ba5bb6215ecf180dd8679d5c0cc2a271.webm?t=1769776492\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3612160/extras/ba5bb6215ecf180dd8679d5c0cc2a271.mp4?t=1769776492\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Expedition Management</strong> \u2013 Recruit and grow your units to form a unique, customized expedition team.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3612160/extras/4269164bf61aa2e9e8ba84b9e0043f04.poster.avif?t=1769776492\" width=500 height=278 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3612160/extras/4269164bf61aa2e9e8ba84b9e0043f04.webm?t=1769776492\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3612160/extras/4269164bf61aa2e9e8ba84b9e0043f04.mp4?t=1769776492\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Resource Gathering &amp; Crafting</strong> \u2013 Secure your survival through lumbering, mining, and item crafting.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3612160/extras/ce2995fe006e8320dc8c99c6327f193a.poster.avif?t=1769776492\" width=500 height=280 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3612160/extras/ce2995fe006e8320dc8c99c6327f193a.webm?t=1769776492\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3612160/extras/ce2995fe006e8320dc8c99c6327f193a.mp4?t=1769776492\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Development Intent &amp; Background</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Battle Brothers have deeply inspired me with their strategic depth and atmosphere.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As 1 person team, I\u2019ve spent several years creating this game as a tribute to these exceptional title.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >I will continue developing Ashen Dungeon to deliver its own unique and compelling experience, and I sincerely welcome your ongoing feedback and support.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3612160?t=1769776492","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3612160?t=1769776492","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3612160/4b53e6d7e785efd3a07e1fc9d3dc086aed148fb4/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1769776492","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3612160/4b53e6d7e785efd3a07e1fc9d3dc086aed148fb4/capsule_1